 "text": {
  "what": "A Campbell, California shop themed on \"craziness\", with donut names punning on mental illness, a straitjacket on the wall and a padded cell in the room.",
  "story": "Jordan Zweigoron and Kipp Berdianski opened it in March 2009; Berdiansky left the partnership that July. A San Jose location and a Santa Clara location have both closed, as has a 2021 pop-up at Valley Fair.\n\nThe theme has drawn objection from mental-health advocates, which is part of the shop's public record rather than an aside to it.",
  "today": "Still open in Campbell."
